loads/origins/ecb67dba-aa93-4ae9-86ad-619d9efa1b12?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=335b1af7e7916c285bea9ec163fd5a2c, https://si.imgix.net/f4d237df/uploads/origins/ecb67dba-aa93-4ae9-86ad-619d9efa1b12?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=74e89c61a3cdf6072b8360b569a6ec5a 2x, https://si.imgix.net/f4d237df/uploads/origins/ecb67dba-aa93-4ae9-86ad-619d9efa1b12?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=10cf9c8f862c3520f6521765d7e81d1c 3x"}, "body": "I'd like to ask a Birthday picture for my OC. She's Douma's lover and he's very affectionate with her, but he's still a demon and in the Kimetsu no Yaiba universe he has a collection of skulls that he takes care of, and even puts them in pots to better decorate them. I'd like a picture where Douma is gifting one that resemble my OC to her and my OC reacted with an awkward smile and an evident shade of disgust. And make my OC have her sleeve next to her mouth, she often does that when she wants to conceal her emotions in an elegant way. Also i'd like if they were both sitting since Douma is usually seen sitting like in the picture i posted as reference. \nDouma height = 187 cm\nmy OC height = 155 cm\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1jix1gKFLbWpkfmU_VsFMm3Pj6vdF2juX", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@hairstarfish/works/5", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 510042, "client_id": 2813855, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/e783871e/uploads/origins/7a9bd9b5-5413-4317-9aca-65011a9da4a0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ecf6aee975526cbbf3d6a67840fea84a", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/e783871e/uploads/origins/7a9bd9b5-5413-4317-9aca-65011a9da4a0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ecf6aee975526cbbf3d6a67840fea84a, https://si.imgix.net/e783871e/uploads/origins/7a9bd9b5-5413-4317-9aca-65011a9da4a0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f5b3faccc1e3274420ac3c453c2b3cab 2x, https://si.imgix.net/e783871e/uploads/origins/7a9bd9b5-5413-4317-9aca-65011a9da4a0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=501c9cfc4cfcbfce8476577424297f78 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/e783871e/uploads/origins/7a9bd9b5-5413-4317-9aca-65011a9da4a0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=560a16f1df02426ba75a4589a1af7d8f", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/e783871e/uploads/origins/7a9bd9b5-5413-4317-9aca-65011a9da4a0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=560a16f1df02426ba75a4589a1af7d8f, https://si.imgix.net/e783871e/uploads/origins/7a9bd9b5-5413-4317-9aca-65011a9da4a0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=aef09d555450404220bf3ef8bc1eb682 2x, https://si.imgix.net/e783871e/uploads/origins/7a9bd9b5-5413-4317-9aca-65011a9da4a0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=cec00a5a47d7422e878e059f6486fd41 3x"}, "body": "毛星様\n\nこんにちは、あまれとと申します。\n今回はご依頼ご失礼に致します！\nもし条件に合えばぜひ、お願いできればと存じます (値段の調整も全然大丈夫です！)。\n\n【依頼内容】\n- OC達の原画を描いて頂ければと思っております。\n- OC A(以下\"ピンク\")がOC B(以下\"うさぎ\")に対する片思いに陥ったきっかけを原画風に盛り込みたいです!\n- 詳細については、資料を参考にしていただければ助かります。\n\n【参考】\nピンクのキャラー (以下 「ピンク」)\n- 純粋で世間知らずのお姫様風のアイドル\n- 恥ずかしがり屋の天然系ですが、ウサギの限定では愛情アピールにとても積極的です。\n  恥ずかしいけど、好き好き大好きでしょうがない！みたいな感じです。\n- ウサギの隠れた大ファンで、ゲームの中でも、現実の本人的にもでもウサギと恋人に発展したいという気持ちでいっぱいです。 \n\nウサギのキャラー  (以下 「ウサギ」)\n- 「ウサギ星雲から降りてきたウサギ星人」を主張している電波系腹黒ポップアイドル。 \n  実際の本人は全く正反対ですが、ストレス解消のためにこんな遊びをしています。\n- 実際にはとても理性的で冷静な性格で、ピンクの幻想が壊れるのを恐れて壁を立てていますが、だんだん…\n- ツンデレ気があり、「本物の天然」であるピンクの猪突的な愛情攻勢に巻き込まれ、途方に暮れています。\n\n【用途】\n- Twitter, 個人ブログに (描いてぐださった毛星様のお名前を記載後)掲載し、自己満足\n\n長文失礼いたしました。\n条件が合えば ぜひ、ご検討の程よろしくお願い致します。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1pfYx7MbACDE4NWUxRUaFogtI6733IneF?usp=sharing", "nc": 16, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@hairstarfish/works/4", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 510042, "client_id": 1365331, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/fdf9636c/uploads/origins/7fc3720e-1e97-4cff-8c64-0bbaed82a97b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=11f87fb1fd1715a74573711c45916da9", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/fdf9636c/uploads/origins/7fc3720e-1e97-4cff-8c64-0bbaed82a97b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=11f87fb1fd1715a74573711c45916da9, https://si.imgix.net/fdf9636c/uploads/origins/7fc3720e-1e97-4cff-8c64-0bbaed82a97b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9b934d01e5de632a14c265ad6cf29eda 2x, https://si.imgix.net/fdf9636c/uploads/origins/7fc3720e-1e97-4cff-8c64-0bbaed82a97b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f4ae634e00a8557950139152baec58de 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/fdf9636c/uploads/origins/7fc3720e-1e97-4cff-8c64-0bbaed82a97b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=86dee2e37b31fb4f80b05d537409d784", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/fdf9636c/uploads/origins/7fc3720e-1e97-4cff-8c64-0bbaed82a97b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=86dee2e37b31fb4f80b05d537409d784, https://si.imgix.net/fdf9636c/uploads/origins/7fc3720e-1e97-4cff-8c64-0bbaed82a97b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=a4